    "display_name": "Psychology",
    "long_instructions": "## Talk to a Psychologist\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Ask the psychologist for a few examples of how work in their field has contributed to the development of AI.\r\n2. Pick an example that you find interesting and ask for details to complete the questions in your Activity Guide.\r\n\r\n::: details [**Not sure what to ask?**]\r\nTry a prompt like this:\r\n> What are some examples of innovations in psychology that have helped develop AI?\r\n:::",
